Hi Avery,

With Q4 a week away, here are three things small-company admins tell us they wish they'd started in September.

1. Benefits renewal. Your health plan renewal quotes typically arrive in October. Gusto now shows a side-by-side of your current plan and this year's options, with the cost per employee, so the decision takes an afternoon.

2. Year-end bonuses. If you're planning any, set the pool now; Gusto can run a separate bonus payroll with the right withholding in one click.

3. Headcount budget. Gusto's new compensation benchmarks show what companies your size and location pay for the roles you're hiring, by percentile.

Read the Q4 planning guide: https://mail.gusto.com/l/q4-planning-2026

